  "description": "Kim Ki-Beom was sickly since birth and \nlived a life close to death, but his passion was hotter than anyone else's. He continued his passionate activities for Christianity while going through various incidents, but\neven after becoming a pastor, the numerous illnesses that plagued him did not go away, and only desperate incidents continued... This is the story of the life of Kim Ki-beom, the first Korean pastor who evangelized numerous people in Incheon despite continuous hardships .\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11885744), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/65669048), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5353000343)",
